# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ClearAudit — root environment (scripts only)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The web app has its own frontend/.env.local (see frontend/.env.example).
# Nothing here is needed to run the app; these values are for the headless
# verification and alt-mempool scripts.

# Read-only checks (npm run verify:chain). Defaults to the public Arc RPC.
ARC_RPC_URL=https://rpc.testnet.arc.io

# ── EF alt-mempool reproduction (scripts/claim.ts) ────────────
# Devnet chain 1337. Addresses come from deployments.json, not from here.
# Use a dedicated, minimally-funded key: on the devnet this key is the
# protocol and the relayer, and it never holds customer funds.
PROTOCOL_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
DEAL_ID=1
ALT_MEMPOOL_RPC=https://altmempool.forshtat.com/rpc
ALT_MEMPOOL_READ_RPC=https://altmempool.forshtat.com
